<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says no comment on Nokia rumour.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says no comment on Nokia rumour.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications firm LM Ericsson AB on Wednesday declined to comment on a rumour that it was planning to merge with Finnish rival Nokia.  </p>
<p>&quot;We never comment on rumours like this. If we have something to say, we will,&quot; Ericsson spokesman Lars Stalberg told Reuters.</p>
<p>Shares in Ericsson and Nokia rose sharply on market rumours that the two would merge. Ericsson closed up 9.5 crowns at 206 and in Helsinki Nokia ended up 3.5 markka at 251.5.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
